MODULE: BudgetReleasesNoAbandon
TARGET: BudgetReleases
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: budget expiry fails to return drive ownership
PERTURBS: DriveOpportunity

--- FIND
        ![l].drive = IF leaf[l].left = 1 THEN "none" ELSE @,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: outer-frame abandonment retains ownership.
        ![l].drive = @,
--- END
